          "anchors": [
            "from"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "Each agent is: - 🎯 Specialized: Deep expertise in their domain (not generic prompt templates) - 🧠 Personality-Driven: Unique voice, communication style, and approach - 📋 Deliverable-Focused: Real code, processes, and measurable outcomes - ✅ Production-Ready: Battle-tested workflo",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.249919+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "7b528b4a3e8deb0e2d0a42ef62fe151c9fbed4902ac9d5925293cdaae71ecd6a",
          "excerpt": "Each agent is: - 🎯 Specialized: Deep expertise in their domain (not generic prompt templates) - 🧠 Personality-Driven: Unique voice, communication style, and approach - 📋 Deliverable-Focused: Real code, processes, and measurable outcomes - ✅ Production-Ready: Battle-tested workflo",
          "sentence_hash": "8b34f11d00e15971f594641ecbe235cb2814469af43f7a8902724400238c9599",
