    {
      "version": 1,
      "id_scheme_version": 1,
      "article_id": "a1_d076f069304830b7288b9ec6",
      "headline": "hugohe3/ppt-master",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "English | 中文 This project is kept free and open source with the support of Kimi, PackyCode, APIKEY.FUN, RunAPI, YouYun ZhiSuan and other sponsors.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.251454+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d503b75d8763f3225d5a99535c780dec75a8ff6a33b588a1fc84c60e3ac89574",
          "excerpt": "English | 中文 This project is kept free and open source with the support of Kimi, PackyCode, APIKEY.FUN, RunAPI, YouYun ZhiSuan and other sponsors.",
          "sentence_hash": "ba4e9e17f0155434475835ad206c9d709c2681eb469e33938d24e2af022ee5d1",
          "anchors": [
            "with",
            "中文"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "With PPT Master, K3 can understand source materials such as PDFs, DOCX files, and web pages, identify key points, structure the narrative, and generate a natively editable PPTX that you can continue refining in PowerPoint.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.251487+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d503b75d8763f3225d5a99535c780dec75a8ff6a33b588a1fc84c60e3ac89574",
          "excerpt": "With PPT Master, K3 can understand source materials such as PDFs, DOCX files, and web pages, identify key points, structure the narrative, and generate a natively editable PPTX that you can continue refining in PowerPoint.",
          "sentence_hash": "5411ee35e2c26bc481efef7b0e365705dbeaf6ff0dd19cb563c86987984a4955",
          "anchors": [
            "you",
            "editable",
            "point"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Try Kimi Code, or access the API through the Kimi Open Platform (中文站 | Global).",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.251501+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d503b75d8763f3225d5a99535c780dec75a8ff6a33b588a1fc84c60e3ac89574",
          "excerpt": "Try Kimi Code, or access the API through the Kimi Open Platform (中文站 | Global).",
          "sentence_hash": "c030e46e8613d005aa6db197114e73244a7d8aa527364c0e0bf9473e46b8a262",
          "anchors": [
            "中文",
            "中文站"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "It hands you a real PowerPoint: slide masters, native shapes, data-backed charts and tables — not flat text boxes, and not a filled-in template.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.251523+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d503b75d8763f3225d5a99535c780dec75a8ff6a33b588a1fc84c60e3ac89574",
          "excerpt": "It hands you a real PowerPoint: slide masters, native shapes, data-backed charts and tables — not flat text boxes, and not a filled-in template.",
          "sentence_hash": "b5a6968f69d153e71ccecf4b3e25ed9f6492970da982a11b241285b91a5041e9",
          "anchors": [
            "you",
            "master"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "It also does more than lay slides out nicely — it reasons the argument into shape first, then designs; and that native depth keeps converging with PowerPoint itself, adding more of its native capabilities release after release.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.251546+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d503b75d8763f3225d5a99535c780dec75a8ff6a33b588a1fc84c60e3ac89574",
          "excerpt": "It also does more than lay slides out nicely — it reasons the argument into shape first, then designs; and that native depth keeps converging with PowerPoint itself, adding more of its native capabilities release after release.",
          "sentence_hash": "239777225539c1aa2449ae4a753b4426679d0d67eb4efab837c81e4d2ada84ee",
          "anchors": [
            "with"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "In form, it's a workflow that runs inside any agent-capable AI tool: hand the AI your topic or material, and it generates on your machine — your data stays local, no platform or model lock-in.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-14T08:04:25.251609+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d503b75d8763f3225d5a99535c780dec75a8ff6a33b588a1fc84c60e3ac89574",
          "excerpt": "In form, it's a workflow that runs inside any agent-capable AI tool: hand the AI your topic or material, and it generates on your machine — your data stays local, no platform or model lock-in.",
          "sentence_hash": "619581c76ca5ecee44486a8e0539f7edfe882cc64f8a2b53a0f016c79df3057e",
          "anchors": [
            "you",
            "run"
          ]
        }
      ],
